        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Heat Beam"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(evocation, fire, occult)\n\nThe immolis targets a living creature within 30 feet and directs a beam of volatile psychic energy toward it, increasing the rate at which the creature's body produces heat. The target must attempt a DC 20 Fortitude save. The second and third time an immolis uses Heat Beam in the same round, the DC lowers to 16 or 12, respectively.\n\n- **Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Failure:** The creature takes 2d6+5 fire damage.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature takes 4d6+5 fire damage and 5 persistent fire damage."
            },
